1
00:00:00,158 --> 00:00:04,748
(Sheldon:)I distinctly ordered the Leonard Nimoy
Mr. Spock cardboard standee.

2
00:00:04,912 --> 00:00:09,082
(Sheldon:)Why would I feel safer with
Zachary Quinto at the foot of my bed?

3
00:00:10,293 --> 00:00:13,673
(Penny:)I don't know.
He was pretty badass on Heroes.

4
00:00:15,089 --> 00:00:17,629
(Sheldon:)You're right. I'll give him a shot.

5
00:00:19,218 --> 00:00:20,798
(Penny:)Hang on.

6
00:00:21,095 --> 00:00:24,015
- Penny, you have plans for dinner?
- You guys going somewhere?

7
00:00:24,223 --> 00:00:26,313
(Leonard:)No, I mean just you and me.

8
00:00:26,517 --> 00:00:28,807
(Amy:)Ooh.

9
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:31,270
(Penny:)Have you thought this through?

10
00:00:32,523 --> 00:00:35,613
(Leonard:)Yes. And I think we should go anyway.

11
00:00:37,653 --> 00:00:40,113
(Sheldon:)No, can't do it.
Sorry, Quinto, you're going back.

12
00:00:47,538 --> 00:00:50,998
(Amy:)If you and Leonard get back together,
Sheldon and I will finally have...

13
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:54,507
(Amy:)- ...someone to go on double dates with.
- What about me and Howard?

14
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:56,880
(Amy:)Fine, we can double with you too.

15
00:00:57,048 --> 00:00:59,128
(Amy:)So insecure.

16
00:01:00,635 --> 00:01:03,225
(Bernadette:)Where are you guys going to eat?

17
00:01:03,846 --> 00:01:05,886
(Bernadette:)Penny?

18
00:01:06,557 --> 00:01:12,067
(Minister:)Do you, Penny, take Leonard
to be your lawful wedded husband?

19
00:01:19,445 --> 00:01:23,405
(Penny(turning, heavily pregnant):)Well, it's a little late for me
to start saying "no," isn't it?

20
00:01:25,034 --> 00:01:26,114
(Bernadette:)Penny?

21
00:01:26,535 --> 00:01:30,495
Sorry. I just remembered
I've got to stop by the drugstore.

